{"s":102,"name":"At-Takathur","meaning":"Competition","arName":"سُورَةُ التَّكَاثُرِ","type":"Meccan","verses":8,"juz":30,"page":600,"basmala":true,"ayahs":[{"a":1,"ar":"أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":2,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","en":"Until you visit the graveyards.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":3,"ar":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"No! You are going to know.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"Then no! You are going to know.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":5,"ar":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":6,"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","en":"You will surely see the Hellfire.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","juz":30,"page":600},{"a":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","juz":30,"page":600}]}